{#- Inline SVG icons. Inlined rather than fetched so there is no extra request and
    no relaxation of the same-origin CSP. All use currentColor, so they inherit the
    button or link colour rather than needing a fill per context.

    chevron and linkedin geometry are the real exports from Figma
    (nodes 2227:7956 and 2227:8083); download is hand-drawn to match their weight. -#}

